# Full environment variable reference for agentic-media.
# See README.md for the setup/deploy guide these variables belong to, and
# CLAUDE.md for deeper implementation notes.
#
# Only the "Frontend" section below is a real dotenv file meant to be copied to
# .env.local for `npm run dev`. The "GitHub Actions secrets" and "Vercel
# environment variables" sections are NOT read from a local .env file — they're
# configured in GitHub repo Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions, and in
# the Vercel project's Environment Variables settings, respectively. They're
# listed here (with no values) so every variable the project needs is
# documented in one place.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend (.env.local) — copy this section to .env.local with real values
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Supabase project URL (e.g. https://xxxxxxxx.supabase.co)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=

# Supabase anon/public key (safe for the browser; RLS restricts access to the owner)
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub Actions secrets (repo Settings > Secrets and variables > Actions)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN   Claude Pro/Max OAuth token (`claude setup-token`),
#                           format sk-ant-oat01-…. Used headless by generate.yml
#                           and evals.yml. No Anthropic API billing involved.
# SUPABASE_URL              Same Supabase project URL as above, for server-side scripts.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY Service-role key; bypasses RLS. Used only by
#                           generate.yml/publish.yml/cleanup.yml — never the frontend.
# SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF      Supabase project ref (the xxxxxxxx in the project URL),
#                           used by migrate.yml to `supabase link` before `db push`.
# SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN     Personal access token from supabase.com/dashboard/account/tokens,
#                           used by migrate.yml to authenticate the Supabase CLI.
# SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD      Database password from Project Settings > Database,
#                           used by migrate.yml to link/push migrations.
# PEXELS_API_KEY            Pexels API key for background image search (generate.yml).
# YT_CLIENT_ID              YouTube Data API v3 OAuth client id (publish.yml).
# YT_CLIENT_SECRET          YouTube Data API v3 OAuth client secret (publish.yml).
# YT_REFRESH_TOKEN          YouTube Data API v3 OAuth refresh token, scope youtube.upload.
# YT_PRIVACY_STATUS         Optional. One of private|unlisted|public; defaults to
#                           "private" if unset or invalid (see scripts/publish.ts).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vercel environment variables (Vercel project Settings > Environment Variables)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# GITHUB_DISPATCH_TOKEN     Fine-grained GitHub PAT scoped to this repo (dispatch only),
#                           used by api/dispatch.ts to fire repository_dispatch events.
# GITHUB_REPOSITORY         "owner/repo" the dispatch route targets.
# SUPABASE_URL              Same Supabase project URL, for api/dispatch.ts to validate
#                           the caller's session (or use VITE_SUPABASE_URL instead).
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY         Anon key for api/dispatch.ts's session check (or use
#                           VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY instead). Never the service-role key.
